     </widget>
     <widget class="QComboBox" name="p_product">
      <property name="geometry">
       <rect>
        <x>70</x>
        <y>27</y>
        <width>264</width>
        <height>26</height>
       </rect>
      </property>
      <property name="toolTip">
       <string>LR: the ocean, one file per pass (pole to pole), 2 km pixels on two 60 km wide swaths, gridded over the region. Basic has the heights, Expert adds the radar backscatter, wave height and wind speed. LR L3 (AVISO+): the same passes calibrated, edited and denoised by CNES/CLS, with the mean dynamic topography and (Expert) geostrophic currents; needs the AVISO+ login. HR Raster: rivers, lakes and coasts, a ready-made UTM grid per 128 km tile. HR rivers and lakes: the river reaches (lines), river nodes (points, every 200 m) and lakes (outlines) of one pass, from zipped shapefiles, drawn over the window.</string>
      </property>
      <property name="refresh" stdset="0">
       <bool>true</bool>
      </property>
     </widget>
