      <property name="geometry">
       <rect>
        <x>70</x>
        <y>59</y>
        <width>264</width>
        <height>26</height>
       </rect>
      </property>
      <property name="toolTip">
       <string>The array to show. ssha_karin: sea surface height anomaly (tides, mean sea surface and atmosphere removed); ssh_karin: height above the ellipsoid; the _2 versions use a model wet troposphere instead of the radiometer. wse: water surface elevation. Rivers and lakes: the attribute shown when hovering a feature (wse, width, slope, discharge…). Once the file is on disk the list is the file's own.</string>
      </property>
     </widget>
     <widget class="QLabel" name="lbl_quality">
      <property name="geometry">
       <rect>
        <x>11</x>
        <y>91</y>
        <width>55</width>
        <height>26</height>
       </rect>
      </property>
      <property name="text">
