      </property>
     </widget>
     <widget class="QComboBox" name="p_quality">
      <property name="geometry">
       <rect>
        <x>70</x>
        <y>91</y>
        <width>264</width>
        <height>26</height>
       </rect>
      </property>
      <property name="toolTip">
       <string>Uses the variable's own quality field (variable_qual), when it has one; for rivers and lakes, the feature's quality attribute (reach_q, node_q, quality_f); for L3, its quality_flag (Good: 0; Good and suspect: up to 30, AVISO's own advice). Good: no flag raised. Good and suspect: also the values flagged only as suspect, not those degraded or bad. Every value: no quality filter.</string>
      </property>
      <property name="currentIndex">
       <number>1</number>
      </property>
      <item>
       <property name="text">
        <string>Good only</string>
       </property>
      </item>
      <item>
       <property name="text">
        <string>Good and suspect</string>
       </property>
      </item>
      <item>
       <property name="text">
        <string>Every value</string>
