     <widget class="QCheckBox" name="p_xover">
      <property name="geometry">
       <rect>
        <x>190</x>
        <y>123</y>
        <width>144</width>
        <height>26</height>
       </rect>
      </property>
      <property name="toolTip">
       <string>L2 LR heights only (ssh_karin, ssha_karin and their _2 twins): add the file's crossover calibration, height_cor_xover. The L2 heights do not include it, and without it a pass shows a tilt of up to a metre or more ACROSS the swath (the KaRIn roll/phase error), not ocean signal. Leave it on unless you study that error. L3 heights are already calibrated.</string>
      </property>
